WEBVTT

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:23.960
<b>Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? III</b>

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:34.320
Ikelos Familia
King of Atrocity

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:38.260
Get 'em!

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:18.180
Isn't working, Dix. This one's strong.

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:18.980
Huh?

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:21.910
Come on. It's just one little critter.

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:44.750
Bringing in a big guy like you 
brought us a world of hurt once.

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.320
You...

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:47.590
aren't needed!

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:55.720
Foh!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.350
Foh?

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:12.810
No...

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:15.470
No!

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:20.800
Wiene! Don't!

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.500
Don't go looking away!

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:25.590
Foh!

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:27.600
No...

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.310
No...

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.860
No!

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:37.510
Don't worry, monster.

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:40.150
You won't be getting left out.

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.770
Thank you for the meal.

00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:06.730
Bell-kun!

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:10.680
I'm just going to head to 
the Dungeon for a bit.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:14.470
Don't worry. I'll be back soon.

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.530
This one...

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:33.990
Sure gave us a bunch of trouble, didn't you?

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:37.610
Hey, you lot.

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:40.250
Quit dawdling and get to hauling 
this vouivre and the others.

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:44.210
There might be some other 
group sniffing around again.

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:48.890
And what're you trying to be sneaky about?

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.720
Spider silk...

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.350
Like Ariadne's thread, huh?

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.550
Not letting you do that.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.490
This one's no good.

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:04.900
Let her get too close, 
and there might be a fire.

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:07.660
Deal with her here.

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:13.260
Hey. Hey, Dix.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:14.290
Huh?

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:19.360
If we're just gonna kill it anyway, 
can we... have some fun with it first?

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:22.050
Do whatever you want.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.550
I go first.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.120
Th-Then, I'm next.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.550
Moron. I'm next!

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.640
Behave yourself, okay?

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:35.940
I'll never get enough of this!

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:41.550
I-It's hot!

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.260
It's burning me!

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.780
What're you guys doing?

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:50.700
This monster...

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:10.720
You lowlifes... will never 
violate this body.

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:12.460
I will not allow it!

00:06:14.050 --> 00:06:15.850
This body...

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:18.360
And even my death...

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:21.470
I won't let you have them!

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:27.890
Gros...

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:29.870
I leave the rest...

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:30.890
to...

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:45.310
I-It went and dropped dead on its own.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.270
Yeah, that's true.

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:52.760
The only one who can do as they
please with you is yourself!

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:57.510
Might've been a monster, 
but we'd get along pretty well.

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:01.600
Let's go.

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:46.560
<i>Please, don't hesitate 
about killing monsters.</i>

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:49.850
<i>Don't waver out of consideration for us.</i>

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.640
<i>I can defeat them.</i>

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:06.690
<i>But...</i>

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:09.340
<i>I can't do it the way I have up to now.</i>

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:19.810
<i>Regular monsters aren't like Wiene,
 Lyd-san, or the other Xenos.</i>

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:23.270
<i>It's true. Monsters kill people.</i>

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:27.220
<i>But does that make it all 
right to kill monsters?</i>

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:29.680
<i>To make money...</i>

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:32.030
<i>To get closer to what you aspire to...</i>

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:38.420
Ais-san...

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:44.010
Has something happened, Fels?

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:45.330
No.

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:47.880
I have continued my observations,

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.100
but as I thought, those particular hunters,

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:53.310
the Ikelos Familia... there is no sign 
of them entering or exiting Babel.

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:57.320
Either they are still 
within the dungeon, or...

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:00.310
As we have feared for some time,

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:04.270
there is a way to enter the Dungeon 
other than through Babel.

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:07.470
How do the Xenos fare right now?

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:12.360
As planned, they are moving from 
one hidden village to another.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.690
Word that they have arrived has not yet—

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:18.160
What is it?

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:21.110
The crystal I gave Lyd 
has stopped responding.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.590
What are you doing, Gros?

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:28.160
Why did you break the crystal?

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:30.870
Now we have no way to contact 
Fels and the others.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:34.780
There is no need for us to listen 
to what Fels has to say!

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:37.150
It's obvious what we must do!

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:38.350
Calm down, Gros.

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:41.350
I saw everything...

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:43.310
Heard everything...

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.340
What those humans did...

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:48.330
The way Ranieh and the others died!

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:51.630
We don't need Fels and 
the others to help us!

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:53.080
And I won't let them stand in the way!

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:55.270
We will put an end to 
this with our own hands!

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:56.740
This is retribution!

00:09:56.740 --> 00:10:00.970
We will avenge Ranieh and the others,
 and retrieve our kin!

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:04.640
Those humans will receive our vengeance!

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:06.210
W-Wait!

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:08.030
I will kill them.

00:10:08.030 --> 00:10:09.870
All who stand in my way will face the same!

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:11.760
I'll kill them all!

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:15.920
Are you trying to make everything 
we've done so far count for nothing?

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.710
The dreams of everyone who died?

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:22.290
The adventurers, the humans... 
not all of them are bad!

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:25.150
There are people like Bell-cchi 
and the others. That's why—

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:27.540
How many times must you be betrayed?

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:30.470
That kid is just the same.

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:32.610
One day, he'll abandon us.

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:36.000
People and monsters cannot coexist!

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:38.540
Get that through your head already, Lyd!

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:42.130
We will bring our kin back!

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:44.880
Ranieh's will and determination 
won't have been spent in vain!

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:46.010
Yeah!

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.020
It's no good, Lyd.

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:55.750
There's no stopping them now.

00:10:56.790 --> 00:11:00.250
I'm sorry, Fels... Bell-cchi...

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:02.840
Rei. Lett.

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:05.710
Come with me.

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:07.230
I'm going after Gros and the others.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:08.430
All right.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:09.840
Yes, sir.

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:11.980
Arles, you go pick up that guy.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:15.380
He should have arrived in the village 
where we were supposed to meet up.

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:19.860
Let's go!

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:29.290
Falgar, they've appeared.

00:11:29.590 --> 00:11:31.210
It's guys from Ikelos.

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:33.970
Bors!

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:38.110
The monsters are agitated. 
Something isn't right.

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:41.330
That's...

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:53.260
I, um...

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:57.030
I'm sorry for making you make time for me.

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:57.730
It's fine.

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:04.170
Ais-san...

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:09.120
Ais-san, if monsters had a reason to live...

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:12.580
If they had emotions that weren't 
any different from ours...

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:13.740
What would you do?

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:21.490
If monsters come bringing harm, then...

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:22.740
No.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:30.800
If someone will be made to cry 
because of monsters, then...

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.450
I will kill monsters.

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:46.610
I...

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:54.650
<i>This is an emergency alert! 
This is an emergency alert!</i>

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:59.320
<i>All familias affiliated with Orario, 
please follow Guild directions.</i>

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:02.010
<i>The Guild will now officially 
issue a mission!</i>

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:13.740
<i>On the Eighteenth Floor, Livira has been 
attacked by armed monsters and destroyed.</i>

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:16.190
<i>All adventurers will now expend every effort</i>

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.270
<i>to exterminate the monsters 
which attacked Livira—</i>

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:20.450
<i>What?</i>

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:22.490
<i>That can't be... Understood!</i>

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:25.000
<i>We've just received notification 
from the Guild.</i>

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:29.070
<i>All citizens, including adventurers, 
are forbidden from entering the Dungeon.</i>

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:32.260
<i>All familias, please stand by in your Homes.</i>

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.910
The monsters are moving on a massive scale?

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:33.910
<i>I repeat.</i>

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.250
It can't be...

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:37.680
<i>All citizens, including adventurers, 
are forbidden from entering the Dungeon.</i>

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:38.390
Lyd-san...

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:39.760
Wiene...

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:43.590
Hey! What's going on?

00:13:44.180 --> 00:13:46.350
Are they saying the Xenos attacked the town?

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:49.500
I don't know! With just that 
to go on, I don't know!

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:52.300
If, in the one in a million 
chance that's true, then...

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:53.590
all of the Xenos...

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:55.550
Wiene-sama and the others...

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:57.430
What will happen to them?

00:13:57.960 --> 00:14:01.060
Monsters dangerous enough 
to have destroyed Livira...

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:04.220
For Orario not to subdue them... 
that is not an option.

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:07.890
One way or another, 
this will be brought to an end.

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:11.150
Lord Ouranos,

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:13.340
why have you issued such an order?

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:15.130
Calm down, Leumann.

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:19.390
B-But if we continue to allow 
the monsters' incursion,

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:21.580
the authority of the Guild will...

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:26.210
If the aim was truly to 
emerge on the surface,

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:29.080
they would already have broken though Babel.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:33.110
Most importantly, my blessing 
has not been broken.

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:35.680
Th-That is true...

00:14:36.070 --> 00:14:39.060
For many familias, to attempt 
to execute this task

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:41.160
would only invite further, 
unwanted confusion.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:45.310
Formation of a subjugation force will be 
entrusted entirely to the Ganesha Familia.

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:47.760
As you wish.

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:51.240
I will issue further instructions 
in due course. Go.

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:52.370
Yes, my lord.

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:56.700
This is a problem.

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:58.350
Indeed.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:02.340
To explain the situation before 
things grew more violent,

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:05.250
and bring them together. 
That was the ideal, but...

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:06.740
Yes.

00:15:07.350 --> 00:15:08.330
Fels...

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:10.390
Ready a familiar.

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:11.970
Then...

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:17.540
We will select all those who will 
participate in this mission,

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:19.350
and you will accompany them.

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:21.120
Furthermore,

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:23.890
Bell Cranel will be included in the mission.

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:27.560
Ouranos... That would be...

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:30.350
This is where we will see the truth.

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:31.980
The truth of that boy...

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:36.220
the only adventurer to have 
joined hands with the Xenos.

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:40.860
Is he a child, simply swept 
along by circumstances...

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:43.750
Or is he a doll made to dance by the gods?

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:46.160
Or perhaps...

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.150
What's going on?

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:49.180
Livira's been wiped out!

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:50.810
Are the monsters headed this way?

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:51.920
They're crazy strong...

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:55.370
Eina-san!

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:56.760
Oh! Bell-kun!

00:15:57.020 --> 00:16:00.730
Please, tell me! The monsters 
that attacked Livira...

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:03.680
According to the people 
who managed to escape,

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:06.280
they were equipped with 
weapons and protective gear.

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:09.780
Apparently, they were lead 
by a savage gargoyle, but...

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:11.690
It seems there were all kinds 
of different species...

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:17.620
The Guild is moving toward entrusting the 
Ganesha Familia with the suppression team.

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:21.090
There may be other requests 
made of other familias,

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:23.180
so, Bell-kun, you should stand by at your Home.

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:25.130
W-Wait, Eina!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:28.530
What?

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:29.770
"Summoned"? You mean...

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:31.710
Ouranos-sama has asked for Bell-kun?

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.830
Standby? You've gotta be kidding me!

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:39.800
Why do we have to leave this to 
those guys in the Ganesha Familia?

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.530
Even given the change in the mission...

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:44.640
This seems entirely too unnatural.

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:46.470
Well, in any case...

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:50.220
I don't think things will end 
this way. I'm sure of it.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:52.310
Though it's just a hunch.

00:16:53.730 --> 00:16:57.260
I don't really like being left 
out of the loop like this,

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:59.420
but I'm with Finn here.

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:03.550
This is gonna keep going, 
dragging Orario around in its wake.

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:10.220
It seems even Ouranos has 
things he feels guilty about.

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:13.580
He seems to want very much 
for us to keep our distance.

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:21.180
Did you mess things up, Dix?

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:27.760
Man, this has really turned 
into something fun!

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:29.240
What?

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.280
Bell-kun hasn't come back yet?

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:33.830
That's right. Not since 
he went to the Dungeon.

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:36.160
The Dungeon's already been locked down.

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:39.520
Even those of us in Babel were evacuated.

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:42.120
So where could he be?

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:46.060
Hestia-sama! This is for you!

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:47.410
It's from the Guild.

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:53.540
"Prepare for the event of an 
emergency as reserve forces"...

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:55.760
What does that mean?

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:58.020
It means to maintain our current status...

00:17:58.020 --> 00:17:59.880
to simply wait aboveground.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:05.590
Bell-kun will be included in the suppression 
force headed to the Eighteenth Floor?

00:18:05.590 --> 00:18:07.070
What?

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:10.360
What are you thinking, Ouranos?

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:14.210
There is no time.

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:16.490
Listen as you are, Bell Cranel.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:21.250
As far as can be surmised from the 
statements of the adventurers who escaped,

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:27.420
after attacking Livira, the Xenos have 
not moved from the Eighteenth Floor.

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:28.300
What?

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:29.350
It is very likely

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:32.270
that the cause of their 
agitation lies there,

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:34.540
and keeps them there even now.

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:38.800
But as to what that is, we have 
no choice but to see for ourselves.

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:42.090
But... how will we get 
to the Eighteenth Floor?

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:45.370
We will secretly insert you 
into the suppression force

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:48.030
as a means of sending you into the Dungeon.

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:54.070
Will you go, Bell Cranel?

00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:57.760
I ask this of you, too! 
Please allow me to go!

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:00.010
I have to go...

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:02.610
to where Wiene is!

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:08.620
To involve Bell-kun in this...

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:10.980
you've really done it this time, Ouranos!

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:12.920
This is unexpected.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.990
I thought you would refer 
to it as a trial, as usual,

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:17.710
and happily go spur Bell Cranel on.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:20.510
This time, it's a different story.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:23.730
One wrong step will lead 
to destruction, you see.

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:26.290
What is the status of Falgar and the others?

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:28.510
They managed to escape death.

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:34.850
Asfi, work independently of Ganesha's 
group and head to the Eighteenth Floor.

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:37.970
Gather as much information as you can.

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:39.360
What will you do, Hermes-sama?

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:42.270
I've got somewhere to go, too.

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:45.860
I'm worried about Bell-kun.

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:47.770
Summon Aisha, too.

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:50.710
Cranel-san is part of the suppression force?

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:51.620
Yes.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:55.610
After a bunch of monsters went 
on a rampage, destroying Livira,

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:57.970
it seems they've stopped 
on the Eighteenth Floor.

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:00.500
Why bring this to me?

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:02.930
This is me meddling.

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:06.890
I'm saying this because you seem to 
have a fondness for Bell Cranel,

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:10.140
but that boy is being made to 
cross a dangerous bridge.

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:12.520
But how do you know this?

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:17.430
Because after my conversion, 
I ended up with the Hermes Familia.

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:19.750
Why would you join that faction?

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:22.530
A lot has happened.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:25.440
It's just one of those things where 
our interests happen to align.

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:29.400
So will you be going to 
the Eighteenth Floor?

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:31.950
I see.

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:37.080
This is not, after all, a simple mission.
 Is that what you mean?

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:38.160
Yes.

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:42.120
It seems the Ikelos Familia 
are involved in this.

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:44.040
The Ikelos Familia?

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:49.040
There's rumors they're connected 
to the dark faction, Evilus.

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:51.250
Evilus?

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:54.530
I understand.

00:20:55.240 --> 00:20:57.350
I will go, as well.

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:10.380
Dix!

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:13.480
They say armed monsters have attacked Livira!

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:16.030
Everyone's gone crazy out there.

00:21:16.030 --> 00:21:18.240
Armed monsters?

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:20.690
Come on, are you serious?

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:25.750
That means our prey has come of its 
own free will to attack us, right?

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:28.720
Our honored patron god hasn't 
come back yet, either.

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:32.020
Well, then...

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:35.420
What shall we do?

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:39.610
Listen well!

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:42.860
Our aim is to tame the monsters.

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:44.660
Do not kill them. Bring them in alive.

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:46.940
Are you sure this is right?

00:21:46.940 --> 00:21:49.620
Our master is Ganesha.

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:52.370
We trust in him and follow him.

00:21:52.730 --> 00:21:54.420
Am I wrong, Ilta?

00:21:56.850 --> 00:21:58.290
We go!

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:01.800
Yeah!

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:40.940
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:40.940
<b>Knossos
Man-Made Labyrinth</b>

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:38.130
Next time,

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:39.350
"Knossos."
